msgstr "已清除翻譯快取（{lines} 行）：畫面上的內容會重新翻譯"

msgid "translation is off: no cache to clear"
msgstr "翻譯已關閉：沒有可清除的快取"

msgid "picture cache cleared ({mb} MB freed)"
msgstr "已清除圖片快取（釋放 {mb} MB）"

msgid "from:to pairs of hex colours, comma separated (e.g. 01183c:111d3b turns AnonTW's time-stop navy into a softer blue; empty: none)"
msgstr "以逗號分隔的十六進位顏色 原:新 對（例如 01183c:111d3b 把 AnonTW 時間停止的深藍變成柔和的藍色；留空：無）"

msgid "Recolor"
msgstr "重新著色"

msgid "recolouring off"
msgstr "重新著色關閉"

msgid "no colour pairs understood in \"{value}\" (write from:to, e.g. 01183c:111d3b)"
msgstr "「{value}」中沒有可辨識的顏色對（寫成 原:新，例如 01183c:111d3b）"

msgid "1 colour recoloured (the game still sees its own colours)"
msgstr "已重新著色 1 種顏色（遊戲看到的仍是原來的顏色）"

msgid "{n} colours recoloured (the game still sees its own colours)"
msgstr "已重新著色 {n} 種顏色（遊戲看到的仍是原來的顏色）"

msgid "the game shows as it prints itself"
msgstr "遊戲照原樣顯示"

msgid "the Translator is file: no translator is used"
msgstr "翻譯器為 file：不使用翻譯器"

msgctxt "translating"
msgid "the game"
msgstr "遊戲"

msgctxt "translating"
msgid "dialog"
msgstr "台詞"

msgid "translating {what} into {lang} from {files}, else with {engine}"
msgstr "正在把{what}譯成 {lang}：來自 {files}，否則用 {engine}"

msgid "translating {what} into {lang} with {engine}"
msgstr "正在把{what}譯成 {lang}：用 {engine}"

msgid "translating {what} into {lang} with {engine} (--translate-load: {files})"
msgstr "正在把{what}譯成 {lang}：用 {engine}（--translate-load：{files}）"

msgid "translating {what} into {lang} from {files} (no translator)"
msgstr "正在把{what}譯成 {lang}：來自 {files}（無翻譯器）"

msgid "the Translator is file, but no translation file was given: start with --translate-load (or --translate-storage) and a translation log"
msgstr "翻譯器為 file，但未指定翻譯檔案：請用 --translate-load（或 --translate-storage）和翻譯記錄啟動"

msgid "the Translator is file, but --translate-load gave nothing: {files}"
msgstr "翻譯器為 file，但 --translate-load 沒有讀到任何內容：{files}"

msgid "last translation failed: {error}"
msgstr "上次翻譯失敗：{error}"

msgid "the number the random generator started from (read-only); set EMUERA_SEED=N before starting for repeatable runs; RANDOMIZE / INITRAND in the game change it"
msgstr "亂數產生器起始的數字（唯讀）；如需可重複的執行，請在啟動前設定 EMUERA_SEED=N；遊戲中的 RANDOMIZE / INITRAND 會改變它"

msgid "the seed at startup (read-only); never changes even when the game calls RANDOMIZE or INITRAND"
msgstr "啟動時的種子（唯讀）；即使遊戲呼叫 RANDOMIZE 或 INITRAND 也不會改變"

msgid "↑↓ choose  ←→ / Enter change  Esc close"
msgstr "↑↓ 選擇  ←→ / Enter 變更  Esc 關閉"

msgid "emuera-tty settings"
msgstr "emuera-tty 設定"

msgid "memory"
msgstr "記憶體"

msgid "translating {queued}, failed {failed}, cached {cached}"
msgstr "翻譯中 {queued}，失敗 {failed}，已快取 {cached}"

msgid "settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "working"
msgstr "處理中"

msgid "can't write {file}: {error}"
msgstr "無法寫入 {file}：{error}"

msgid "Infinite loop detected"
msgstr "偵測到無限迴圈"

msgid "Confirm exit"
msgstr "確認結束"

msgid "Exit anyway"
msgstr "仍然結束"

msgid "Wait for the line to finish"
msgstr "等待該行結束"

msgid "Now running line {line} of {file} (@{func}).\n{ms} ms have passed since the last input.\nStop the script? (unsaved progress is lost)"
msgstr "正在執行 {file} 的第 {line} 行（@{func}）。\n距上次輸入已過 {ms} 毫秒。\n要停止指令碼嗎？（未儲存的進度會遺失）"

msgid "Are you sure? You may also wait for the line to finish (lines may occasionally freeze up)."
msgstr "確定嗎？你也可以等待該行結束（行偶爾會卡住）。"

msgid "stopped by the player: a possible infinite loop"
msgstr "被玩家停止：可能是無限迴圈"

msgid "Tab completion for {shells} in {dir} (zsh: add {zdir} to fpath)."
msgstr "已將 {shells} 的 Tab 補全裝到 {dir}（zsh：把 {zdir} 加入 fpath）。"

msgid "Tab completion"
msgstr "Tab 補全"

msgid "at an input, Tab completes what is typed to a button's value (by its start or a word of the button's text) or an @ command; Tab again shows the next one"
msgstr "在輸入處按 Tab，把已輸入的內容補全為按鈕的值（依值的開頭或按鈕文字中的詞尋找）或 @ 指令；再按 Tab 顯示下一個"

msgid "any value: wait for the terminal to answer after each frame, so frame rates measure the terminal (tools/termbench.sh)"
msgstr "任意值：每個畫格之後等待終端機回應，使畫格率反映終端機的速度（tools/termbench.sh）"
